  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eriya Addukira e Kolebu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Akabu n'abuulira Yezeberi byonna Eriya bye yakola, ne bwe yatta bannabbi bonna n'ekitala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yezeberi n'atumira Eriya omubaka okumugamba nti, \"Bakatonda bankole bwe batyo n'okukirawo, bwe siifuule obulamu bwo okuba ng'obulamu bw'omu ku bo, essaawa nga zino enkya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriya n'atya nnyo, n'adduka okuwonya obulamu bwe. Bwe yatuuka e Beeruseba mu Yuda, n'aleka eyo omuweereza we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ye n'atambula olugendo lwa lunaku lumu mu ddungu, n'atuuka awali omwoloola, n'atuula wansi waagwo, n'asaba afe. N'ayogera nti, \"Kino kimala,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", kaakano twala obulamu bwange, kubanga sisinga bajjajjange.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'agalamira wansi w'omwoloola ne yeebaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 19:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amangwago malayika n'amukomako, n'amugamba nti, \"Golokoka olye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'agolokoka, laba ng'emitwetwe we waliwo akasumbi k'amazzi n'omugaati omwokye. N'alya n'anywa, n'addamu n'agalamira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malayika wa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'akomawo omulundi ogwokubiri n'amukomako n'amugamba nti, \"Golokoka olye, kubanga olugendo lunene.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo n'agolokoka n'alya, n'anywa, n'afuna amaanyi, era n'atambula olugendo lwa nnaku amakumi ana emisana n'ekiro, okutuuka e Kolebu, olusozi lwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alabikira Eriya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yatuuka eyo, n'ayingira mu mpuku, n'asula omwo. Awo ekigambo kya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kimujjira nga kigamba nti, \"Okola ki wano, Eriya?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'addamu nti, \"Nyiikidde nnyo okuweereza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda ow'Eggye ne nkwatibwa n'obuggya ku lulwe. Abayisirayiri balese endagaano yo, bamenye ebyoto byo, era ne batta ne bannabbi bo n'ekitala. Nze nsigaddewo nzekka, ne kaakano bannoonya okunzita.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'amugamba nti, \"Ffuluma, oyimirire ku lusozi mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali kumpi kuyitawo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 19:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kale laba, embuyaga nnyingi ey'amaanyi n'emenya ensozi n'eyasa n'enjazi mu maaso ga Eriya, naye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga taliimu. Oluvannyuma lw'embuyaga, musisi ow'amaanyi n'ayita naye era",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga taliimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluvannyuma lwa musisi ne wajja omuliro, naye era",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teyaliimu mu muliro. Oluvannyuma lw'omuliro, ne wajja eddoboozi ttono nga lya ggonjebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriya bwe yaliwulira, n'abikka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "amaaso ge n'omunagiro gwe n'afuluma n'ayimirira ku mulyango gw'empuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 19:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'amugamba nti, \"Okola ki wano Eriya?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'addamu nti, \"Nyiikidde nnyo okuweereza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda ow'Eggye, naye Abayisirayiri balese endagaano yo, bamenyeemenye ebyoto byo, era ne batta ne bannabbi bo n'ekitala. Nze nsigaddewo nzeka, ne kaakano bannoonya okunzita.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.19.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'amugamba nti, \"Ddirayo mu kkubo lye wajjiddemu ogende mu ddungu lya Ddamasiko. Bw'onootuuka eyo ofuke amafuta ku Kazayeeri okuba kabaka w'e Busuuli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne ku Yeeku mutabani wa Nimusi okuba kabaka wa Isirayiri, ate era ofuke n'amafuta ku Erisa mutabani wa Safati ow'e Aberumekola okudda mu kifo kyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Yeeku anatta oyo yenna anadduka okuwona ekitala kya Kazayeeri, ate Erisa ye n'atta oyo yenna anadduka okuwona ekitala kya Yeeku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabula nesigaliza akasanvu mu Isirayiri, abatavuunamiranga Baali wadde okumunywegera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuyitibwa kwa Erisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Eriya n'ava eyo n'asisinkana Erisa mutabani wa Safati ng'alima n'emigogo gy'ente kkumi n'ebiri, ye ng'alimisa ogw'ekkumi n'ebiri. Eriya n'agenda gy'ali n'amusuulako omunagiro gwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa n'aleka ente ze, n'adduka ng'agoberera Eriya. N'amugamba nti, \"Ka nsibule kitange ne mmange, ndyoke ŋŋende naawe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1KI 19:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eriya n'amugamba nti, \"Ddayo, nkukoze ki?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Erisa n'amulekako akabanga, n'addayo, n'agenda n'asala omugogo gw'ente, ennyama n'agifumbisa ebiti by'enkumbi, n'agabira abantu ne balya. Awo n'agolokoka n'agoberera Eriya era n'amuweerezanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
